  "reason": "The current best (config_019, acc=0.725) uses scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + multiprofile + multimodal + transformer + weighted. The evidence strongly identifies scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l as the optimal encoders, and multiprofile as superior to singleprofile. Within this best-encoder space, we have tested transformer/weighted (0.725), transformer/concat (0.721), and avgpool/weighted (0.706). Config_018 (avgpool/concat) is the only untested aggregation-fusion combination in this top-tier encoder space. While it is unlikely to surpass the current best (since both avgpool and concat are individually suboptimal), it is the most logical exploitation choice: it maintains the two most impactful design decisions (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l) and completes the factorial exploration of the remaining axes. As the final experiment, it provides the cleanest confirmation of the interaction structure between aggregation and fusion within the best-encoder regime, and has the highest expected accuracy among all remaining untested configurations that preserve the proven encoder choices."
}

